      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእመ ፡ ቦ ፡ ዘሜጦ ፡ እምነ ፡ ጌጋዩ ።⟫",
